{
  "title": "Octanuclear Ln(III)-Based Clusters Assembled by a Polydentate Schiff Base Ligand and a β-Diketone Co-Ligand: Efficient Conversion of CO2 to Cyclic Carbonates and Large Magnetocaloric Effect",
