      "synthesis": {
        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "Shared solvothermal synthesis of clusters 1–3: Ln(acac)3·2H2O (0.03 mmol; Ln = Gd for 1) and H2L (0.03 mmol) were added to 15 mL of C2H5OH/CH2Cl2 (v/v = 4:1) and stirred for 3 h. The mixture was transferred to 20 mL glassware, sealed, and heated in a drying oven at 70 °C for 48 h, affording yellow block-shaped single crystals of 1.",
