        "summary": "Cluster 1 shows antiferromagnetic Gd···Gd coupling and a large magnetocaloric effect (−ΔSm = 33.06 J kg−1 K−1 at 2.0 K and 7.0 T). No frequency-dependent out-of-phase AC signal. UV–vis absorptions at 204, 254, 305, and 358 nm; ligand-centered emission near 450 and 470 nm with lifetime 7.38 μs.",
